{'symbol': 'TT', 'date': '2023-04-11 06:30:00', 'title': 'TRANE® BY TRANE TECHNOLOGIES CELEBRATES 110 YEARS OF PIONEERING INNOVATION', 'text': 'SWORDS, IRELAND--(BUSINESS WIRE)--TRANE® – BY TRANE TECHNOLOGIES (NYSE: TT), A GLOBAL CLIMATE INNOVATOR – IS CELEBRATING ITS 110TH ANNIVERSARY AS A WORLD LEADER IN CREATING COMFORTABLE, ENERGY EFFICIENT INDOOR ENVIRONMENTS FOR COMMERCIAL BUILDINGS, INDUSTRY AND HOMES. THE TRANE COMPANY WAS INCORPORATED IN 1913, 28 YEARS AFTER JAMES TRANE AND HIS SON REUBEN STARTED A FAMILY PLUMBING BUSINESS IN LA CROSSE, WISCONSIN.'}